OL,3,GNEWSAPregnancy risk from abuse 'great
OL,4,Athrill', court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former councillor who advertised
OL,7,Fonline for strangers to have sex with
OL,8,Fhis wife without her consent said the
OL,9,Frisk of getting her pregnant was "a
OL,10,Fgreat thrill", a court has heard.
OL,12,FPhilip Young, a former Tory councillor
OL,13,Ffor Swindon, has admitted to drugging
OL,14,Fand raping his now ex-wife Joanne, over
OL,15,F13 years. She has waived her legal
OL,16,Fright to anonymity.
OL,18,FIn an advert read to the jury earlier,
OL,19,FYoung wrote it was his one of wife's
OL,20,Ffantasies for anonymous men to have sex
OL,21,Fwith her while she was drunk and tied
OL,22,Fup.
